{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Virellion Mansion \u2014 where the walls whisper, and your neighbors might be possessed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pull Me In</i> is a dark life simulation game blending the charm of decorating your house with the creeping dread of psychological horror. Decorate your home. Build relationships. Watch TV. Perform an exorcism. Nothing is as it seems behind the smiling faces and quiet streets of Virellion Street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possession System</strong> \u2013 NPCs and player characters can be taken over by demons. Study them carefully, perform exorcisms, or risk becoming the next vessel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Decorate</strong> \u2013 Furnish your haunted home, room by room. Every item affects your sanity, your comfort, and your safety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Purpose System</strong> \u2013 Choose a Purpose: become an Exorcist, Doll Collector, Serial Killer, Demon Summoner, Cannibal, UFO Enthusiast, Ghost Hunter and Robotics Engineer. Each unlocks unique gameplay, dialogue, and events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Relationships</strong> \u2013 Talk, flirt, spy, or eliminate your neighbors. Some are innocent. Some\u2026 are hiding something.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Lore</strong> \u2013 Discover the truth behind the cursed Virellion Mansion, the burning of Ysadora the Witch, and what really happened in the places you can visit around the city.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live your life. Fight your urges.<br>But remember:<br><strong>Something in this town is watching.</strong><br>And it wants to pull you in.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100630?t=1761604904","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.st